    "overview": "The Intex ThunderCool HC 85 Desert Air Cooler is built for powerful cooling in medium to large rooms. Featuring a large 85-litre water tank, it provides longer cooling duration with fewer refills. The cooler is equipped with 4-way air deflection for uniform air circulation and a high-performance motor that delivers strong air throw even during peak summer heat. The 3-side honeycomb cooling pads improve water retention and enhance cooling efficiency. Designed for convenience and durability, the HC 85 is inverter compatible, has a shock and rust-proof body, and comes with 360° moving wheels for effortless movement. It is an ideal solution for those seeking high-capacity, long-lasting summer cooling.",
